xt photo is of spider-man and the  iron spider suit this is a super cool  photo of this suit it looks like a shiny  brand-new car and according to Peter  Parker smells like one too super  to see a still of the iron spider suit  to see the design the colors and the  effort that went into it this next photo  is of Drax and Thanos and although the  fight between Drax and Thanos on Titan  was very brief I think it definitely  demonstrated that Drax is just no match  for Thanos you can see here by the  expression on Drax's face and thanasis  face Drax is just nothing compared to  fan oohs this next one is of Bucky who  an Avengers infinity war dropped the  title of being the Winter Soldier and  became the white wolf you get a really  good close-up look of his new vibranium  arm here and as you can see no star on  it next one is awesome as well  it's got Thor with Stormbreaker in his  arm and his new armor a lot of black  going on here normally his arm armor is  kind of more silver but it's a lot of  black and I'm wondering if they did this  because black is the color morning and  he lost a lot of people when Thanos  attacked a ship also worth mentioning is  that he is holding Stormbreaker  like a hammer not like an axe as you can  see the hammer head is actually facing  down and the axis facing up but we all  know that at the end it was the axe that  went right into Thinnes chest this next  photo is really awesome because it's  always really cool to see Doctor Strange  uses magic but as you can see in this  photo his magic is having just zero  effect on Thanos you have to keep in  mind just how strong Santos is without  the stones but give him the stones and  he's unstoppable doesn't matter how  strong you are these next few photos  right here are of Iron Man's nanotech  suit the really cool thing I liked about  the nanotech suit is how slick and sleek  it is the nanomachines form right to his  body so as you can see the suit takes on  the shape of his body it's not a clunky  huge piece of machine that Tony wears  his armor it's actually formed to his  body so in a way he actually kind of  becomes more one with his suit this  photo is of curva slave on the left and  one of Thanos has outriders on the right  I really like the design for Corvus  glaive it's  comic-book accurate even though he  didn't really get that much screen time  I thought we would see the children of  Thanos a little bit more but I certainly  understand when you have so many  characters in a story it's really hard  to give them a lot of screen time  individually and the outriders were  super cool they definitely gave us a  great battle in Wakanda  these next two photos are of doctor  strains and Wang and in the first photo  it shows dr. strange getting banner out  of the hole that he made when he fell  into the sanctum sanctorum as the Hulk  something we didn't see on screen so  it's nice to know how banner got out of  there and the next one is the fight  between doctor strains and ebony MA  apparently this was supposed to get a  little bit more film time than it did  again you have so many characters that  you have to fit into two and a half  hours I understand why this was a really  cool scene though and I would have loved  to have seen just a little bit more of  it  and this last amazing shot right here is  of the mad Titan Thanos there he stands  in all of his power at his home planet  of Titan but if you look closely at the  Infinity Gauntlet you can tell a slight  difference the Infinity stones are not  in the same place that they were in in  the movie I'm not sure if this means  that they originally planned on Thanos  getting the stones in a different order  or if the artists just randomly threw  the stones into the Infinity Gauntlet  when they designed this either way still  an awesome photo so that does it for all  the new Avengers infinity war concept  art that was released let me know what  you all think of this new concept art in  the comments below 